# What `gcloud builds submit` uploads. Without this file gcloud derives the
# list from .gitignore, which keeps the sample invoices and the Terraform state
# in the upload; the build needs neither, and a smaller upload is a faster
# build in a room on conference wifi.
.git/
.venv/
.claude/
.terraform/
infra/
tests/
docs/
samples/
.local_records.jsonl
__pycache__/
*.pyc
